    "sha": "199e4c2d978f26e9d489c935739dcf7f2128a702",
    "node_id": "C_kwDORrDnANoAKDE5OWU0YzJkOTc4ZjI2ZTlkNDg5YzkzNTczOWRjZjdmMjEyOGE3MDI",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "gnosyslambda",
        "email": "gnosyslambda@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-03-19T06:51:10Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "gnosyslambda",
        "email": "gnosyslambda@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-03-19T06:51:10Z"
      },
      "message": "Fix incorrect ETag weak indicator stripping in is_not_modified\n\nstrip(\" W/\") removes individual characters from the set {' ', 'W', '/'}\nfrom both ends of the string, which can mangle ETag values that happen\nto end with those characters. Use strip() + removeprefix(\"W/\") instead\nto only strip whitespace and then remove the literal W/ prefix.\n\nSigned-off-by: gnosyslambda <gnosyslambda@gmail.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "0a046f34971e8013e8dfb953d5642b7e9058f02e",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/git/trees/0a046f34971e8013e8dfb953d5642b7e9058f02e"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kludex/starlette/git/commits/199e4c2d978f26e9d489c935739dcf7f2128a702",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQQR7CsbRH2dMOE9YZFdrhDOk1jOhwUCabuc3hsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQXa4QzpNYzocSAwD+JGulvRU+1EZWbSnmNtHN\nRa1LpDqIoEu6pFsaSEYR998A/RXMsKYr8R2+yASDN7g1VTTNtv8qEZTUg/xT0p+V\nJ0YP\n=eTYD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree 0a046f34971e8013e8dfb953d5642b7e9058f02e\nparent 9ee951980bae776103715b66305f807d9e8245da\nauthor gnosyslambda <gnosyslambda@gmail.com> 1773903070 +0900\ncommitter gnosyslambda <gnosyslambda@gmail.com> 1773903070 +0900\n\nFix incorrect ETag weak indicator stripping in is_not_modified\n\nstrip(\" W/\") removes individual characters from the set {' ', 'W', '/'}\nfrom both ends of the string, which can mangle ETag values that happen\nto end with those characters. Use strip() + removeprefix(\"W/\") instead\nto only strip whitespace and then remove the literal W/ prefix.\n\nSigned-off-by: gnosyslambda <gnosyslambda@gmail.com>\n",
        "verified_at": "2026-03-19T06:51:18Z"
      }
    },
